#### CloudWatch Metrics Collection

**Required Metrics (Primary):**

| Metric Name | Namespace | Dimension | Threshold | Alert Action |
|-------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|-------------|
| CPUUtilization | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID | >85% (5 min) | Page on-call engineer |
| MemoryUtilization | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID | >90% (5 min) | Investigate JVM heap |
| NetworkInBytes | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID | >500 MB/s | Plan vertical scaling |
| NetworkOutBytes | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID | >500 MB/s | Plan vertical scaling |
| KafkaDataLogsDiskUsed | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID | >85% | Verify auto-scaling |
| ProduceLocalTimeMsMean | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name, Broker ID, Topic | >200ms | Investigate bottleneck |
| ConsumerLag | AWS/Kafka | Consumer Group, Topic, Partition | >1M messages | Scale consumers |
| UnderReplicatedPartitions | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name | >0 | Critical alert |
| OfflinePartitionsCount | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name | >0 | Critical alert |
| ActiveControllerCount | AWS/Kafka | Cluster Name | != 1 | Critical alert |

